  "summary": "Deploy engineering agents with confidence with Rescale's agent evaluation approach, anchored by the Rescale Agent Fidelity Toolkit (RAFT). Rescale RAFT combines response scoring, tool-use validation, ground-truth checks, and continuous monitoring to systematically verify that agents deliver relevant answers and take correct actions, providing the quality discipline that production agentic engineering demands.",
